## 2. The Two Halves of the Pipeline

| | PART 1 — Ingest (write path) | PART 2 — Chat (read path) |
|---|---|---|
| Who | **Admin / Registrar** | **Student** |
| Action | upload a PDF/DOCX/TXT/CSV/MD | type a message in the chat widget |
| Destination | ChromaDB (knowledge chunks) | ChromaDB (retrieve) + MySQL (tools/memory) |
| Cloud LLM | no (embeddings are local) | yes (Gemini, with fallback) |
| Where in code | `document_routes.py` → `document_service.py` → `indexer.py` → `extractor/cleaner/chunker` → `embeddings/model.py` → `vectorstore/manager.py` | `ai_routes.py` → `chat_service.py` → `graph/orchestrator.py` → agents |

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph WRITE["PART 1 · Ingest (admin upload)"]
        A1[Upload file] --> A2[Extract text]
        A2 --> A3[Clean text]
        A3 --> A4[Chunk into small pieces]
        A4 --> A5[Embed chunks → 384-dim vectors]
        A5 --> A6[(ChromaDB)]
    end

    subgraph READ["PART 2 · Chat (student question)"]
        B1[Question] --> B2[Intent classification]
        B2 --> B3[Build search queries]
        B3 --> B4[Embed queries + vector search]
        B4 --> B5[Rerank + hybrid score]
        B5 --> B6[Top-8 evidence chunks]
        B6 --> B7[LLM generates grounded answer]
    end

    A6 --> B4
```

